  "soar": {
    "observed": "The public Cloud service description and 8.8 GA notice support managed availability by cohort. The on-premises release and upgrade path, OS-specific archive and tested app pairings remain separate. The 8.8 fixed-issues topic labels the body 8.7.0 and the known-issues topic gives no issue IDs. Neither supplied child-topic links. SVD-2026-1108 and SVD-2026-1109 identify a product release floor of 8.8.0. The public download instructions require a community account. The separate public download list and three vendor SHA-512 sidecars identify build 282, commit 81cb9deb, for x86_64 EL8, EL9 and Amazon Linux 2023. The complete issue list remains unknown.",
